# Beyond the Stars (jeuno 135), the level cap alone either side of 85: a level 81 Warrior with the Limit Breaker, New
# Worlds Await and Expanding Horizons completed. Cap 84 and 86: no section (Dormant Powers Dislodged wants Beyond the
# Stars completed), the default 10045 (0, 0, 2, 0); cap 85: 10045 (81, 1, 3, 0).
lists RuludeGardens/Nomad_Moogle/onTrigger RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/10045
char zone=RuludeGardens pos=10.0,1.5,119.9 job=WAR lvl=81
keyitem LimitBreaker
levelcap 84
quest Jeuno.NewWorldsAwait completed
quest Jeuno.ExpandingHorizons completed
login
trigger Nomad_Moogle                    # cap 84: no section; the default 10045 (0, 0, 2, 0)
finish
levelcap 86                             # a GM
trigger Nomad_Moogle                    # cap 86: no section; the default 10045 (0, 0, 2, 0)
finish
levelcap 85                             # a GM
trigger Nomad_Moogle                    # cap 85: 10045 (81, 1, 3, 0)
finish option=0
